      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to documented GET /streams?itemsPerPage=1, matching the pinned validator. SMS send, stream-token fetch, and other writes or two-step messaging calls are omitted.",
        "Native category is messaging: TextPeak is CommPeak's SMS/omnichannel messaging API. Source Communication/Marketing are not in the Rust CATEGORIES allowlist.",
        "Official docs require the raw Authorization header value with no Bearer prefix. Management GETs return HTTP status for errors; the HTTP 200 status:false envelope applies to messaging/OTP sends, which this recipe does not expose. Native bodyErrorPaths cannot invert a success boolean, so HTTP status remains the failure signal for these reads."
      ]
    },
